 +0.4423 on a SINGLE seed (4245), n=52. A surprising result is not
 headline-eligible until replicated (n>1 seeds, same direction; CLAUDE.md).
 RE-RUN the decisive beats-vote gate across >=5 SEEDS (independent fold
 reshuffles of the train/held-out split over the grown pool), report per-seed
 delta + the MEAN delta + a cross-seed CI (and flag any seed where the win
 flips sign). SEPARATELY, an INDEPENDENT clean-room re-score: reload the
 persisted A1/.393 pool artifact and recompute set_encoder@1, vote@1, oracle@K
 via a SECOND code path (not the .393 script) to confirm the numbers reproduce
 off the artifact (mirrors the G2 FoVer independent-reproducer pattern). Emit
 oracle_distinct_win_replicates BARE bool := (mean cross-seed delta>0 AND
 cross-seed CI excl 0 AND the independent re-score lands within the .393 CI).
 verifier_is_oracle=false.

